      "span": "once you run out you can't really progress any further, and the timer is fairly long to recover fully",
      "rule_applied": "Wait to Play: in-game timers that make the player wait; boundary rule requiring the span to describe the wait or resource regeneration schedule, with progress blocked during the wait.",
